<title>UK: TABLE - Enterprise Oil profit rises 40 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Enterprise Oil profit rises 40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		26.0		   vs 18.3</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 17.0		   vs 16.0</p>
<p> Profit after tax	 142.5		  vs 101.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,012.5		vs 762.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast profits in a range between 142.6 and 157.0 million stg. Full name - Enterprise Oil Plc .</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
